WEBVTT

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:02.377
Hey there! I'm going to run through
how Basecamp works.

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:05.547
It's very simple and it's only going
to take me a little over a minute.

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:08.466
So Basecamp is all about projects.

00:00:08.466 --> 00:00:10.635
It only takes a couple seconds
to start one.

00:00:10.635 --> 00:00:15.140
On your Basecamp home page,
just click here and give it a name,

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:19.394
hit create and then add
whatever tools you need from this list.

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:22.439
But let's take a look at a project
that's a little more built out.

00:00:22.772 --> 00:00:25.692
So here's what we have for a logo
redesign.

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.695
These squares are the tools
we're using to get stuff done.

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:30.405
First is the message board.

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:33.158
Instead of sending emails
all over the place,

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:36.786
you post messages here
so everyone on the project can see them.

00:00:37.328 --> 00:00:39.247
Next are to-dos.

00:00:39.247 --> 00:00:43.126
You just add ‘em, assign ’em,
make due dates and people check them off.

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:46.129
Now when you click a to-do
you can see the details of it

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:49.132
as well as the discussions below.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:53.303
You've got a place to store
and share all relevant docs and files,

00:00:53.511 --> 00:00:56.723
a chat room where everyone can discuss
stuff as it happens,

00:00:57.057 --> 00:01:01.561
a calendar for events and deadlines,
and a card table which is

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:06.066
like a Kanban board where you can move
tasks through each part of the process.

00:01:06.107 --> 00:01:10.403
Just click a card to see the details
and discussions about it all on one page.

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:12.238
Which by the way,
there's a comment section

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:16.159
on everything in Basecamp to-dos,
messages, docs, and files.

00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:20.663
That way the conversation always starts
and stays in the same place it started.

00:01:20.663 --> 00:01:21.706
So that's the gist.

00:01:21.706 --> 00:01:22.874
But I'm just going to rapid fire

00:01:22.874 --> 00:01:26.044
go through a few more things Basecamp does
That are super handy.

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:27.087
Down here,

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:31.549
if you click my notes, you can quickly jot
something down or keep a file handy.

00:01:31.883 --> 00:01:35.512
If you go up here and open the sidebar,
you can message someone directly

00:01:35.512 --> 00:01:37.347
without losing your place in Basecamp.

00:01:37.347 --> 00:01:38.515
That one's really nice.

00:01:38.515 --> 00:01:42.727
Choose what pages clients see and then
which ones are private to just your team,

00:01:42.727 --> 00:01:46.356
or share public links with people
who aren't logged in to Basecamp.

00:01:46.856 --> 00:01:49.651
Create timesheets to track hours.

00:01:49.651 --> 00:01:53.571
You can click the Basecamp menu to
instantly get to anywhere from anywhere.

00:01:53.571 --> 00:01:57.033
So your recently visited, any project,
or just type

00:01:57.033 --> 00:01:59.994
something in and jump right to it.

00:02:00.203 --> 00:02:03.998
Bookmark a page, then
fetch it from anywhere in my bookmarks.

00:02:04.082 --> 00:02:04.874
And then while you're down

00:02:04.874 --> 00:02:08.044
here, you can instantly see your activity,
which is all the stuff you're working

00:02:08.044 --> 00:02:11.714
on, any tasks assigned to you,
all upcoming events,

00:02:11.714 --> 00:02:15.468
you can quickly filter for a certain one,
and then everything happening today.

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:18.930
It's just nice to access that stuff
from anywhere in a quick click.

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:20.515
It's really freaking fast.

00:02:20.515 --> 00:02:23.143
Like click
something and boom, you're there.

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:24.811
This is all real time clicking.

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:27.230
No editing happening here.

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:30.233
Record voice notes to quickly
get an idea out of your head.

00:02:30.233 --> 00:02:33.528
And then if you go back to the Basecamp
menu, click this everything button.

00:02:33.528 --> 00:02:36.573
You can look through everything
within specific tools

00:02:36.573 --> 00:02:40.368
like all your messages or docs and files.

00:02:40.368 --> 00:02:41.661
Anything.

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:44.664
If you hold down shift,
you can see all keyboard shortcuts.

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:46.040
That's really handy.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.501
See all recent activity
across your accounts

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:51.546
where you can click wrap up
and just get a summation

00:02:51.546 --> 00:02:55.758
of what happened in your projects,
or get more granular with filters.

00:02:56.259 --> 00:02:59.804
You can click ‘shhh’ to silence
all notifications and pings.

00:02:59.804 --> 00:03:01.014
That way you don't get distracted.

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:03.057
Everyone just shuts up and lets
you do your work.

00:03:03.057 --> 00:03:06.769
And finally, on the home screen,
you got your company logo,

00:03:06.936 --> 00:03:10.773
all your projects, and then the last
five things that happened in your account.

00:03:10.773 --> 00:03:14.861
And if you want, click here
to see more projects on your home screen.

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:15.695
Now there's plenty more

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:19.532
you can do in Basecamp, but honestly, it's
just way better to try it for yourself.

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:22.285
So get in there and get a project started.
